        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "the flame, storytelling, true stories"
      }
    ],
    "http://schema.org/description": [
      {
        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "Hosted by Deborah Williams, Award-winning actor and one of the creators of Mom’s the Word, Deborah Williams is bringing the hit storytelling event, The Flame, back to Gateway Theatre. The Flame is a storytelling series that features real people, sharing their personal true stories in front of a live audience. Since its inception in 2009, The Flame has flourished and grown into a wildly popular event that has packed venues in Vancouver and Victoria."
      }
    ],
